          "text": "Témoignages: FRESNAY-LE-COMTE (28) 25.10.1979 T2 FRESNAY-LE-COMTE (28) 25.10.1979 T1",
          "text_sha256": "7e13a30431d12be74b70fc8f4eddf8c35c437472d1ed3d4abfdf32a903f5efe6"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
